name:Missa: Postcommunio (Dóminus vobíscum and Orémus are sung in the Order of Mass, X: post);
office-part:Oratio;
occasion:Dominica in Ramis Palmarum (Missale O.P. 1939, p. 146);
book:set to the Dominican tone of the Orations at Vespers, Lauds and Mass, Processionarium O.P. (1913), pp. 404-406 (pdf = printed + 16); text from the Missale O.P. (1939), p. 146;
commentary:Proc. p. 404, II: "Modus cantandi Orationes ad Vesperas, Laudes et Missam". One Postcommunion only (the Collect: "Hæc Oratio sola dicatur").;
